{"2725230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Memories: Prologue", "steam_appid": 2725230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories is an episodic psychological horror game based on road thriller, slasher, and survival thriller genres. You are currently viewing the prologue episode of the <strong>Dark Memories</strong> anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/b00f5a0ca930ba7a3ae33c24c6e6be42.poster.avif?t=1766156238\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/b00f5a0ca930ba7a3ae33c24c6e6be42.webm?t=1766156238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Dark Memories: Prologue - Brenton Lake</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue episode of Dark Memories, you play as Benjamin, who is traveling to his friend Sarah's family house at Brenton Lake. As he enters the rural roads, weather conditions rapidly deteriorate and heavy snowfall begins. Benjamin finds himself alone on desolate roads, unaware of what this night has in store for him. The conditions that leave you vulnerable are filled with unpredictable dangers. The Prologue episode covers a small portion of the full story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/f8587898a75ffbe9d05659d7ea8e1e77.poster.avif?t=1766156238\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/f8587898a75ffbe9d05659d7ea8e1e77.webm?t=1766156238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/f8587898a75ffbe9d05659d7ea8e1e77.mp4?t=1766156238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue and messaging system with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prologue episode has an average playtime of approximately <strong>15-20 minutes</strong> and aims to showcase the game's atmosphere and narrative approach.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/c44e902872290f6e9258cf762983d80c.poster.avif?t=1766156238\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725230/extras/c44e902872290f6e9258cf762983d80c.webm?t=1766156238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories is an episodic psychological horror game based on road thriller, slasher, and survival thriller genres. You are currently viewing the prologue episode of the <strong>Dark Memories</strong> anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_para